flowchart TD
  CONTROL[SessionController] --> STORE[SessionStore]
  STORE --> JOURNAL[Append-only JSONL entries]
  JOURNAL --> PARENT[IDs and parent pointers]
  PARENT --> FORK[Inherited fork history]
  CONTROL --> META[Atomic session metadata]
  CONTROL --> UI[Versioned UI sidecar]
  UI --> WORKERS[Worker and review records]
  UI --> MODELS[Model markers and reasoning preference]
  CONTROL --> STATE[Active model and messages]
  STATE --> VIEW[Restore terminal display]
